    "P-142": {
      "note": "auto-retired 2026-08-24: BX no longer appears in a structural-threat factor catalyst -- the finding this trim was sized against has cleared or was superseded | re-opened 2026-08-24: was auto-retired before state.factor_catalysts had been updated with the BX finding this run -- BX now correctly appears in compute_triggers.json's live catalyst_threat list | auto-retired 2026-08-24: BX no longer appears in a structural-threat factor catalyst, and neither the ATR cap nor cluster band independently justifies this trim any more -- the structural reason has cleared | re-opened 2026-08-24 21:07: was incorrectly auto-retired by running the proposals pass against an intraday run-dir that lacked compute_risk/drift/triggers.json -- missing files degraded to 'condition cleared' rather than 'cannot test'. Nothing about these tickers' structural situation actually changed; re-running against the complete run-dir. | auto-superseded 2026-08-03 -- folded into P-163 as a repeat of the same open proposal"
